# Personal workflows — local tracking

**Invariant**: `personal_life(helper ∨ workflow) ⇒ ¬track(public_remote) ∧ track(local_nested_git)` · `track ≡ publish`.

Fleet/generic stays on the public tree. Parent `.gitignore` already ignores the `*.local/` homes.

## Homes

| Class | Home |
|---|---|
| Personal helper scripts | `scripts.local/` (nested git) |
| Private MCP tools | `services/mcp-server/tools/local/` |
| Local pipelines | `pipelines.local/` |
| Local service_ctl plugins | `scripts/model_manager/ui/controller/service_ctl/local/` |
| Life-domain skills | `.cursor/skills/{tax,lawyer-stance,…}` (already ignored) |
| Employer/matter Cursor rules | ignore in place + copy under `scripts.local/cursor-rules/` |
| Fleet / generic | `scripts/`, public `_ws` / `_ulg` |

`∀ new personal helper: write(scripts.local/…) ∧ git -C scripts.local add ∧ ¬git add scripts/`

## Forbidden / Permitted

| Forbidden | Permitted |
|---|---|
| Personal harvest/upsert/ingest under `scripts/` | Same files under `scripts.local/` |
| New `_ws`/`_ulg` rule naming an employer or matter | Ignored life rule + nested-git copy; SOT on `cortex://` |
| Personal defaults baked into public CLIs (employer folder names) | Parameterize, or move the CLI |
| Leave a public-tree copy after relocate | `git rm` the parent path; update runbook cites |

## Anti-patterns

| Bad | Good |
|---|---|
| ESS harvest under `scripts/walgreens/` because “scripts go in scripts/” | `scripts.local/walgreens/` + nested `git add` |
| Track a pharmacy trigger rule as `_ws` for discoverability | Ignore like life skills; runbook stays `cortex://` |
| Relocate the file and leave `scripts/walgreens/` tracked | `git rm` parent; rewrite runbook paths |

